    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23911" root="صدأ" body-key="S">
    
      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تصدّأ لَهُ</span></b> , (K,) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تصدّع له</span>, (TA,) <i>i. q.</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تصدّى له</span>, (K, TA,) which is the original, meaning <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تعرّض له</span> [i. e. <i>He addressed,</i> or <i>applied,</i> or
<i>directed, himself,</i> or <i>his regard,</i> or <i>attention,</i> or
<i>mind, to him,</i> or <i>it;</i> &amp;c.]. (TA.)

